# What building Clotr for Windows writes: Rust's build output and the files Tauri generates from Cargo.toml and
# build.rs (schemas and one permission per command). ui/dist/ is ignored by the root .gitignore.
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/
# tools/msix.ps1's own output: clotr.exe copied in fresh each run, and the packed file.
msix/package/
msix/*.msix
